<Layout><div class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">An open space for curious minds</div><h1>Math makes more sense<br/>when you can move it.</h1><p>Explore a shape. Change an angle. See the why behind the formula.</p></div><span class="intro-note">Your next “oh, I get it” starts here.</span></div><UnitCircle compact/><div class="below-bench"><span>Start exploring: drag the green point, or try a special angle.</span><a class="text-link" href="/unit-circle/">Explore the full unit circle ↗</a></div><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>More ways to make math click.</h2><p>Discover a shape, test an idea, or build a practice sheet.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/tools/">Browse all 17 tools & collections ↗</a></div><ToolCards/><div class="stat-strip"><span><strong>12</strong>visual calculators & explorers</span><span><strong>8</strong>shape guides</span><span><strong>16</strong>concept lessons</span><span><strong>100</strong>practice questions</span></div><div class="learning-strip"><div><h2>A formula is only the beginning.</h2><p>Put your understanding to work with a quick round of practice.</p></div><a href="/practice/">Try a practice round ↗</a></div></Layout>
